Datasets (all free, public 10x Genomics demo data; accessed 2026-10-31)

1. scRNA-seq: PBMC 3k
   - Name: pbmc3k_filtered_gene_bc_matrices
   - Description: 3k peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) from a healthy donor,
     10x Chromium v1 chemistry, filtered feature-barcode matrix.
   - Source URL: https://cf.10xgenomics.com/samples/cell/pbmc3k/pbmc3k_filtered_gene_bc_matrices.tar.gz
   - Local path after download.sh: data/pbmc3k/filtered_gene_bc_matrices/hg19/
   - Loaded with: scanpy.read_10x_mtx

2. Spatial transcriptomics: Visium mouse brain (coronal section)
   - Name: squidpy.datasets.visium_hne_adata()
   - Description: 10x Visium spatial gene expression of adult mouse brain
     coronal section (V1_Adult_Mouse_Brain), ~2.7k spots. Downloaded
     programmatically; raw files cached under data/visium/ on first run of
     scripts/02_spatial_analysis.py.
   - NOTE: the brief preferred human lymph node, but squidpy's
     visium_hne_adata() serves the mouse brain demo; the swap is stated here
     and in the README (per the approved fallback).
   - Loaded with: squidpy.datasets.visium_hne_adata()
